   "contracts6": "\\`{{record-2:spelling}}\\`: which attempt state/log fields are exposed, resource counters, admitted client decisions and visibility policy. Distinguish attempt success from **verified task correctness**; a zero exit code alone may not prove the task's semantic goal."
